2.0.0-rc.31 — three new voices: the VESSEL (a bowed bell, the reverie's own), the REGAL (a reed organ in chapter two and the seizure — sometimes it takes a cadence off the hummers) and the FLUE (a recorder, the rarest speaker); the music box is DAMPED now; lute stop, cello harmonics and drone registrations sit on the desk; every scene rests somebody, and every evening after the first announces its cast in the log
